+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+This project has no current recorded decision specifying a transport compression codec. A search of the repository's documentation, changelog, and configuration turned up no policy or design record naming a required or default codec for transport-level compression; the only related mentions are of unrelated application-level serialization codecs (e.g., JSON/msgpack) and a generic, non-committal reference to "Compression" as a category of middleware. Until such a decision is recorded, no codec should be assumed or implemented as the project standard.
